{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1238191-changeling-2e-errata-thread","id":1238191,"title":"Changeling 2e Errata thread","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-07-24T05:59:13-07:00","id":1238191,"title":"Changeling 2e Errata thread","content":"<b>Changeling: The Lost 2nd Edition</b> is about to go out to backers. Please report any errata you encounter while reading.<br /> <br /> Please note this thread is only for errata. Typos, incorrect math, page elements that overlap incorrectly, etc. This is not for book discussion. Please take discussion of the book to a different thread. Thank you.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Ian A. A. Watson</span></b><span style=\"color:#bdc3c7\">(he/she)</span><br /> <b>Onyx Path Community Manager<br /> Trinity Continuum Content Lead</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4-ianwatson","name":"IanWatson","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4_2.png","title":"Community Manager","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1512"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-24T08:10:07-07:00","id":1238230,"title":"","content":"Hi! Thrilled to have the pdf! However, it appears \u2014on mine, at least\u2014 that some art wasn\u2019t properly loaded. Instead of art on various pages, there is just a green border with a gray box in it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13448-gorillacannon","name":"GorillaCannon","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-24T08:47:10-07:00","id":1238241,"title":"","content":"pg. 3: The Seemings and Courts should be taken down a heading level to match the Kith formatting.<br /> pg. 7: The Page number wraps rather than the Condition name being split into two lines.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>(he/him/his)<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Backer #2010","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1329-elvesofzion","name":"ElvesofZion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1329_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-24T09:10:37-07:00","id":1238250,"title":"","content":"pg. 38: In the second line of the page, it says &quot;war colors&quot; where I assume you're aiming for &quot;warm colors.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12108-gscrap","name":"gscrap","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12108_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"60"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-24T13:08:51-07:00","id":1238336,"title":"","content":"<b>p. 181: </b>&quot;Per Turn Limit: Characters may only spend 1 Willpower per <b>turn</b>.&quot;<br /> <br /> This is at odds with what's in <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> (p. 73) and the other Second Edition cores: &quot;You can only spend one point of Willpower per <b><i>action</i></b>.&quot;<br /> <br /> It's a fiddly distinction, but it's meaningful in certain contexts (a reflexive action to bolster resistance and an instant action to activate a power in the same turn, e.g.). That said, it might be that the <b>Changeling </b>text is corrective and the others are wrong, or this is just a change.<br /> <br /> <b>Edit: </b>The Fairest Blessing (p. 29) says &quot;You may still only spend one Willpower point per <b>action</b>&quot; so I <i>think </i>p. 181 is indeed wrong. <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><b>Social justice vampire/freelancer | He/Him</b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Actual Play:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/852858-vampire-the-requiem-%E2%80%93-bloodlines-ap\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire: The Requiem \u2013 Bloodlines</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Masquiem:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/5268-13-licks-the-curses-of-caine-in-blood-smoke\" target=\"_blank\">Curses of Caine in Requiem 2nd</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Storytellers Vault: </b></span><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=None%20More%20Dark%20Publishing#affiliate_id=321925\" target=\"_blank\">Author Page</a>","edited":{"userid":192,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/192-yossarian","user":"Yossarian","date":". 07-24-2018, 06:49 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/192-yossarian","name":"Yossarian","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar192_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-24T18:21:47-07:00","id":1238449,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>GorillaCannon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1238191-changeling-2e-errata-thread?p=1238230#post1238230\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hi! Thrilled to have the pdf! However, it appears \u2014on mine, at least\u2014 that some art wasn\u2019t properly loaded. Instead of art on various pages, there is just a green border with a gray box in it.</div> </div> </div> </div>To add to this, here are the pages where we have grey boxes:<br /> <br /> 36, 41, 67, 109, 127, 141, 165, 242, 270, 305, and 314.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-24T19:00:09-07:00","id":1238470,"title":"","content":"On page 206 the text says<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Below is a list of example Hedgespinning effects a<br /> player can spend individual successes to accomplish. </div> </div> </div>re:subtle, but the table of subtle Hedgespinning effects occurs on the top of page 204.<br /> <br /> Page 206 also references &quot;drastic changes, listed below&quot; for paradigm shifts, but the table for such changes is on the top of the page.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1452235-proin-s-legacy-hub\" target=\"_blank\">proin's Legacy hub</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2757-proindrakenzol","name":"proindrakenzol","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2757_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1514"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-24T20:36:49-07:00","id":1238496,"title":"","content":"The Leveraged Condition (p.342) appears to be reproduced from its printing in Vampire: the Requiem, where different assumptions about when characters typically sleep and wake are in play; suggest changing &quot;until the sun next sets&quot; to &quot;until the sun next rises&quot; and &quot;Sleeping a full day&quot; to &quot;Sleeping a full night.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-24T22:11:18-07:00","id":1238510,"title":"","content":"p. 32 \u201cBe my lady-in-waiting for a hundred and one years, just that! and soon you\u2019ll be on your way.\u201d<br /> <br /> Extraneous exclamation point. Remove it so it instead reads:<br /> <br /> \u201cBe my lady-in-waiting for a hundred and one years, just that and soon you\u2019ll be on your way.\u201d","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-25T04:48:29-07:00","id":1238554,"title":"","content":"It is not really an Errata but a suggestion: when talking about Arcadian Contracts ( p127 and on), it says they are divided into six regalia. Then you describe each contract of each regalia. Could you please make the titles for each Regalia a bit more distinct, so they would be easier to spot? Like making the font bigger or bolder. Now they look just like the name of any contract and I don't know if it's my OCD kicking in or what but somehow i found it difficult to explore and pinpoint what I was looking for. I guess it is just a matter of being familiar with the content after a few reads, but I thought it might help anyway! Sorry if it is not an appropriate comment for this thread and only erratas are allowed!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13423-leanhaun79","name":"Leanhaun79","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-25T05:11:55-07:00","id":1238558,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>GorillaCannon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1238191-changeling-2e-errata-thread?p=1238230#post1238230\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hi! Thrilled to have the pdf! However, it appears \u2014on mine, at least\u2014 that some art wasn\u2019t properly loaded. Instead of art on various pages, there is just a green border with a gray box in it.</div> </div> </div> </div>Investigating, it appears to be either an issue with your PDF getting corrupted during download, or possibly an issue with your reader. I had one partial gray box/illustration and re-downloaded and it fixed the issue. I suggest re-downloading from your DTRPG library and/or updating your PDF reader or trying on a different device. The illustrations are all there, it's now just a matter of getting them through the Hedge to you! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/22659-kickstarter-james","name":"Kickstarter James","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar22659_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"18"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-25T09:46:21-07:00","id":1238610,"title":"","content":"p 124, Professional Training references a side bar which does not appear to exist.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24017-kblaes","name":"kblaes","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-25T16:16:11-07:00","id":1238713,"title":"","content":"In the first paragraph of the &quot;Supernatural Tolerance and Potency&quot; sidebar on page 101, the last instances of the terms &quot;tolerance&quot; and &quot;potency&quot; are not capitalized.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1423-espritdecalmar","name":"espritdecalmar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1423_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"941"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-26T12:48:25-07:00","id":1239027,"title":"","content":"double post","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1452235-proin-s-legacy-hub\" target=\"_blank\">proin's Legacy hub</a>","edited":{"userid":2757,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2757-proindrakenzol","user":"proindrakenzol","date":". 07-26-2018, 03:53 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2757-proindrakenzol","name":"proindrakenzol","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2757_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1514"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-26T12:53:23-07:00","id":1239028,"title":"","content":"Changeling Character Sheet:<br /> <br /> Touchstones do not appear on the sheet the way they're referenced in the book itself, this makes it confusing to know which line to write down the touchstone.<br /> <br /> Health boxes are not editable, damage cannot be marked on the pdf directly. Clarity boxes are binary like Willpower boxes, they should be editable as text so that / or X can be marked in them.<br /> <br /> Contracts are a mess. The name box is huge, while Goblin contract is an option there's no option for which Regalia or Mantle the Contract uses (should just be a text box for &quot;source&quot; and get rid of the Goblin checkbox. The Dice box is too small to write the actual dicepool (though it is large enough to write the dice, but it's nice to have the pool itself). There's no room to write the Contested dicepool if the action is Contested. The Loophole section is too small to write the majority of the Loopholes. There's nowhere to note the effect of the Contract.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1452235-proin-s-legacy-hub\" target=\"_blank\">proin's Legacy hub</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2757-proindrakenzol","name":"proindrakenzol","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2757_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1514"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-26T20:29:30-07:00","id":1239172,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kickstarter James</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1238191-changeling-2e-errata-thread?p=1238558#post1238558\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Investigating, it appears to be either an issue with your PDF getting corrupted during download, or possibly an issue with your reader. I had one partial gray box/illustration and re-downloaded and it fixed the issue. I suggest re-downloading from your DTRPG library and/or updating your PDF reader or trying on a different device. The illustrations are all there, it's now just a matter of getting them through the Hedge to you! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>Re-downloaded PDF...and I can confirm that that this is true. All of the grey boxes are gone and the artwork is restored.<br /> <br /> Thank you!<br /> <br /> EDIT: ...or I spoke too soon. Artwork is still busted when trying to view it on my iPad Mini 4, iBooks app.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4418,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","user":"tasti man LH","date":". 07-27-2018, 02:14 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-27T11:02:40-07:00","id":1239374,"title":"","content":"Although not technically a typo, p.43 : &quot;Fear is a dangerous emotion to harvest. (...) An animal shelter reeks of the stuff, with stressed animals panicking every time one of them cries out.&quot; seems to imply Glamour could be harvested from animals.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13733-betterworldz","name":"BetterWorldz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13733_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"40"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-27T13:14:05-07:00","id":1239417,"title":"","content":"&quot;General Chronicles of Darkness Terms&quot; (p. 15-17) are missing an entry for &quot;lethal (damage)&quot;. Not a disastrous omission but still a weird one. Perhaps there is still a chance to put it into the lexicon? The same goes for &quot;Mantle&quot; in &quot;Changeling:The Lost Terms&quot; (p. 13-15).<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>One thing is for sure: nothing is for sure.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/83-evolved_lupus","name":"evolved_lupus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar83_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"21"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-27T15:40:34-07:00","id":1239462,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>tasti man LH</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1238191-changeling-2e-errata-thread?p=1239172#post1239172\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Re-downloaded PDF...and I can confirm that that this is true. All of the grey boxes are gone and the artwork is restored.<br /> <br /> Thank you!<br /> <br /> EDIT: ...or I spoke too soon. Artwork is still busted when trying to view it on my iPad Mini 4, iBooks app.</div> </div> </div> </div><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Please take technical issues to another thread.</span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Ian A. A. Watson</span></b><span style=\"color:#bdc3c7\">(he/she)</span><br /> <b>Onyx Path Community Manager<br /> Trinity Continuum Content Lead</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4-ianwatson","name":"IanWatson","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4_2.png","title":"Community Manager","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1512"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-28T03:21:30-07:00","id":1239614,"title":"","content":"Problem:<br /> I have the same problem with the images. But only with this product. All other books from onyx path work fine. So it\u2019s not a problem with my iPad or iBooks.<br /> <br /> Feedback:<br /> My first impression of the book is good. What I am personally missing is a really scary and impressive picture of the Wild Hunt!! <br /> (The overall quality of the images is from fantastic to ok. I think some images could have been replaced by the some of the better art of the first edition.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Waiting for new Chronicles of Darkness Dice! \ud83e\udd17 \ud83c\udfb2","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1825-elythia","name":"Elythia","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1825_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-28T04:52:40-07:00","id":1239628,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Elythia</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1238191-changeling-2e-errata-thread?p=1239614#post1239614\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Problem:<br /> I have the same problem with the images. But only with this product. All other books from onyx path work fine. So it\u2019s not a problem with my iPad or iBooks.<br /> <br /> Feedback:<br /> My first impression of the book is good. What I am personally missing is a really scary and impressive picture of the Wild Hunt!! <br /> (The overall quality of the images is from fantastic to ok. I think some images could have been replaced by the some of the better art of the first edition.)</div> </div> </div> </div>While it\u2019s great you have thoughts about the book, please be aware that this is an errata thread and only for errata. There is a separate thread for the grey box issue, and this is not the thread for that or other art reviews. Thanks!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5-richt","name":"RichT","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5_2.jpeg","title":"Onyx Path Creative Director","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"505"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-28T16:30:39-07:00","id":1239825,"title":"","content":"<u>Missing word</u> - p. 116 First paragraph of the Hollow Merit description: &quot;It may be something as simple a closet door&quot; Needs an &quot;as&quot; after &quot;simple&quot;<br /> <br /> <u>Possible accidental double entendre ?</u> - p. 116 &quot;Size Matters (\u2022 or \u2022\u2022):&quot; Now, I enjoy a fine innuendo as much as the next person, but I'm curious if this is meant to make it into the final version or if it's a joke someone forgot to take out. I'm not offended by it, though it does sorta disrupt the mood alongside creepy things like &quot;Shadow Garden&quot; and &quot;Phantom Phone Booth.&quot; I just want to make sure it's brought to your attention and doesn't get overlooked.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1925-toroid","name":"Toroid","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1925_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"31"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-29T03:35:49-07:00","id":1239966,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BetterWorldz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1238191-changeling-2e-errata-thread?p=1239374#post1239374\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Although not technically a typo, p.43 : &quot;Fear is a dangerous emotion to harvest. (...) An animal shelter reeks of the stuff, with stressed animals panicking every time one of them cries out.&quot; seems to imply Glamour could be harvested from animals.</div> </div> </div> </div>If this is indeed an error, there's a similar issue with p.36, in the middle of a paragraph about desire harvests: &quot;A pet supply store\u2019s adoption event is filled with the animals\u2019 longing for security and belonging&quot;.<br /> <br /> If it's not an error, and animals are meant to be a source of Glamour in 2e, then there's instead an error on p.103: &quot;Changelings can\u2019t harvest Glamour from animals; their emotions are simply too far from human.&quot;<br /> <br /> Either way, a little more consistency would help in avoiding confusion!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24314-itokro","name":"itokro","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24314_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-29T17:26:29-07:00","id":1240256,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Clash of Wills, page 126</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">Each player involved rolls his character\u2019s Wyrd +<br /> appropriate Finesse Attribute.</div> </div> </div> </div>The &quot;appropriate Finesse Attribute&quot; is never defined.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1452235-proin-s-legacy-hub\" target=\"_blank\">proin's Legacy hub</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2757-proindrakenzol","name":"proindrakenzol","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2757_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1514"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-30T20:01:04-07:00","id":1240697,"title":"","content":"p.143 &quot;Leaping Toward Nightfall Loophole: The changeling uses this ability when the target is touching part of the Hedge. A piece removed from the Hedge counts.&quot;<br /> <br /> This may be a bit subjective but I feel the team should double check if they truly intend to make such a powerful Contract always Glamour-free or reflexive when inside the Hedge.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":13733,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13733-betterworldz","user":"BetterWorldz","date":". 08-02-2018, 12:34 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13733-betterworldz","name":"BetterWorldz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13733_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"40"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-30T20:45:29-07:00","id":1240709,"title":"","content":"Sidebar, p.101: &quot;When a Changeling rule calls for Wyrd from a creature who does not possess it, instead use that creature's Tolerance (when contesting effects) or Potency (when forcing effects).&quot; It is unclear from context what &quot;forcing effects&quot; could possibly entail that is not already covered by creatures with a different Supernatural Potency trait having their own rules for how their powers work.<br /> <br /> Sidebar, p.199: Unless &quot;demons&quot; is not meant to refer to the Unchained, Infernal demons or similar supernatural beings, they should probably not be part of a list of examples of characters who do not have Vices.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":111,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","user":"Satchel","date":". 07-31-2018, 02:55 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-31T01:58:44-07:00","id":1240769,"title":"","content":"The cover has the old tagline (Beautiful Madness) not the new one of Bittersweet Truths.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-31T08:32:38-07:00","id":1240886,"title":"","content":"p. 140 Fae Cunning: It isn't clear when you need to spend the Glamour, or how long the effect lasts. Is some part of the Contract always in effect, while others require invocation?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1768-demdemeh","name":"Demdemeh","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"56"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-31T08:47:20-07:00","id":1240892,"title":"","content":"p. 335 Cowed Condition: There is very little space between words in the second line.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24457-draziel","name":"DRaziel","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-07-31T12:38:33-07:00","id":1240993,"title":"","content":"p.338: Dream Intruder lists &quot;Awestruck&quot; as an example Persistent Condition that can be imposed or removed, but there is no Awestruck Condition listed in Appendix Four.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-02T07:14:24-07:00","id":1241809,"title":"","content":"p.148 'Elemental Weapon' Elemental seeming affinity says if they create a weapon that matches their elemental affinity, &quot;it merges with her Mask to make her look terrifying&quot;. While definitely possible to merge with her Mask, it seems like the kind of thing that should merge with the Mein instead.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24249-muattles","name":"Muattles","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-02T14:31:42-07:00","id":1242060,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Muattles</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1238191-changeling-2e-errata-thread?p=1241809#post1241809\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">p.148 'Elemental Weapon' Elemental seeming affinity says if they create a weapon that matches their elemental affinity, &quot;it merges with her Mask to make her look terrifying&quot;. While definitely possible to merge with her Mask, it seems like the kind of thing that should merge with the Mein instead.</div> </div> </div> </div>To add on, since other Seemings can learn seeming affinities, how does the Elemental seeming affinity for Elemental Weapon work with, say, a Beast or Fairest? This should be defined somehow.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1452235-proin-s-legacy-hub\" target=\"_blank\">proin's Legacy hub</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2757-proindrakenzol","name":"proindrakenzol","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2757_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1514"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-02T17:32:43-07:00","id":1242150,"title":"","content":"p.148: Elemental Weapon mentions thrown javelins as a potential archaic weapon and links to the sample weapon charts, which do not include stats for javelins.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-02T22:53:47-07:00","id":1242244,"title":"","content":"<u>Comma splice</u> - p. 209 Second paragraph after Pledges heading: &quot;It isn\u2019t that people can\u2019t ... the Hedge, it\u2019s just dangerous and usually unwise.&quot; Comma here is joining two independent clauses so it should probably be made into a semicolon.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1925-toroid","name":"Toroid","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1925_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"31"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-05T10:47:59-07:00","id":1242981,"title":"","content":"pg. 66 \u201c The voice whispering misogynoir in your ear, coming from the winking man on the other side of the train car. &quot;<br /> <br /> I think y'all meant &quot;misogyny&quot;....<br /> <br /> also on the same page: &quot;But in the end, they were there, and you were to hand.&quot;<br /> <br /> second to last word probably should be &quot;at&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1996,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1996-firefly-night","user":"Firefly Night","date":". 08-05-2018, 02:02 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1996-firefly-night","name":"Firefly Night","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1996_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"150"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-05T17:37:50-07:00","id":1243075,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Firefly Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1238191-changeling-2e-errata-thread?p=1242981#post1242981\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">pg. 66 \u201c The voice whispering misogynoir in your ear, coming from the winking man on the other side of the train car. &quot;<br /> <br /> I think y'all meant &quot;misogyny&quot;....</div> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Misogynoir\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/08/Michelle_Obama2.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=index&amp;utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Misogynoir\" target=\"_blank\"> Misogynoir - Wikipedia </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Misogynoir\" target=\"_blank\"> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Misogynoir </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/478-intrepid-vector","name":"Intrepid Vector","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar478_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"82"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-05T22:07:00-07:00","id":1243118,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> p.215 &quot;All changelings lived for a time in the world of Faerie, which is very like the world of dreams in some ways.&quot; </div> </div> </div>The word &quot;much&quot; seems to be missing.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13733-betterworldz","name":"BetterWorldz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13733_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"40"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-06T01:31:07-07:00","id":1243148,"title":"","content":"<u>Inconsistent capitalization</u> - On p. 147, &quot;mirror space&quot; is uncapitalized; on p. 199, it is capitalized.<br /> <br /> <u>Additional note</u>: Mirror space is not explained beyond being part of the Hedge (p. 147) and having its own kind of Hedgeway gate (p. 199). I appreciate being mysterious, but Storytellers would likely appreciate some idea of what it is like.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1925,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1925-toroid","user":"Toroid","date":".  fixing errors 08-06-2018, 04:34 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1925-toroid","name":"Toroid","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1925_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"31"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-07T07:37:44-07:00","id":1243502,"title":"","content":"p213 the Paragraph that begins with &quot;Consequences&quot; is erroneously in the same box as &quot;Once per chapter&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24498-kirith-sotheril","name":"Kirith Sotheril","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-07T11:19:11-07:00","id":1243553,"title":"","content":"p. 46 &quot;When he finally put his last story away, he said \u201cWell, and now it\u2019s the solstice.\u201d <i>And to her surprise, Autumn admitted defeat.</i>&quot;<br /> <br /> Possibly incorrect use of pronouns? It would make more sense if the hunter was surprised then Autumn.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-08T11:41:05-07:00","id":1243861,"title":"","content":"pg. 148 There's no action type defined for Primal Glory.<br /> <br /> Less certain these qualify as errata, but anyways...<br /> <br /> pg. 146 Mercurial Visage has unclear scope and duration. Some of the fluff like under the Darkling callout implies you have incredibly broad control of the Mask up to and including apparent gender, but phrasing under Mercurial Visage itself only makes mention of altering your face. Given that you would need considerable freedom in shaping for reshaping your Mien to mean anything I'm inclined towards the former reading, but clarification would be nice. There's also no indication of duration; is it scene, similar to Contract default? Or lasting, until you change your face again?<br /> <br /> pg. 143 Whispers of Morning movement while under the effect could use some clarification. Not being effected by physics and passing through all physical barriers means technically you wouldn't be able to propel yourself in any way. Are you intended to effectively be flying during the duration, or totally stationary? Or - as I suspect - is it meant to be more of a conceptual limit where you still walk around as normal, but can will yourself through anything impeding you?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24499-yukidaore","name":"Yukidaore","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}